The Mercedes-Benz Vito SPORT is a higher trim level of the W447 generation Vito, focusing on enhanced styling and features. It sits above the Pure, Progressive, and Premium trims (Result 6, 9). This evaluation is based on the characteristics of the Vito SPORT in the current market, referencing data from recent model years (2019 onwards, as the SPORT trim was reintroduced then, Result 6, 9).

*   **price_usd**: New Vito SPORT Crew Vans start around £37,475 ex VAT (Result 6, 9), which is roughly $47,500 USD. Tourer SPORT models start higher, around £40,570 ex VAT (Result 6, 9). This is above the market average for a new car ($35k). Score: **-0.10**.
